            "text": "<p>Loudlib makes sample packs and Serum presets for tech house, deep house and ambient producers. Drums, basslines, chords and textures, cut on the bar and named with their key and tempo so they drop straight into a session.</p><p>Every pack is royalty free under one short licence, and a demo of each one plays on its page before you buy.</p>",
